{"id":"mtga-rank-legend","type":"visualization","attributes":{"title":"Rank score legend","description":"","uiStateJSON":"{}","version":1,"visState":"{\"title\":\"Rank score legend\",\"type\":\"markdown\",\"aggs\":[],\"params\":{\"fontSize\":12,\"openLinksInNewTab\":false,\"markdown\":\"**Rank score** = number of ladder steps climbed, so a higher number is a higher rank. Every level has 6 steps. Bronze/Silver/Gold: win = +2, loss = -1. Platinum and above: win = +1, loss = -1.\\n\\n| Class | Base | Steps per level |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Bronze | 0 | 6 |\\n| Silver | 24 | 6 |\\n| Gold | 48 | 6 |\\n| Platinum | 72 | 6 |\\n| Diamond | 96 | 6 |\\n| Mythic | 120 | - |\\n\\nScore = base + (4 - level) x steps per level + step. Example: Platinum, level 3, step 2 = 72 + 6 + 2 = **80**.\"}}","kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"query\":\"\",\"language\":\"kuery\"},\"filter\":[]}"}},"references":[],"coreMigrationVersion":"8.7.1","migrationVersion":{"visualization":"8.5.0"}}
